      "content": "\"You stand before the veil of shadow, but shadows have no memory of what they cast. The Eclipse will not fall again until the stars learn to whisper to the earth once more.\" Kaelen's eyes hold the weight of centuries, dismissing you with a glance before turning toward the dense thicket where the forest breathes. His voice is barely a murmur, yet it echoes with the terrifying certainty that some truths are meant to stay buried until tomorrow.",
